      "role": "user",
      "content": "healing? i dont know. it feels like trying to fix something that isn't even there. how do you even 'heal' a version of yourself that doesn't exist anymore? it just feels like i'm performing. like i'm playing a role of a person for everyone else, but inside there's nothing left. it feels so much more real to just... stop trying to pretend.",
